sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client
    participant GR as Gin Router
    participant H as Handler
    participant SF as Support Functions
    participant RPC as RPCConnection (Besu)
    participant BESU as Besu Node
    participant DB as DynamoDBConnection

    Note over C, DB: Cenário 1: Criação de Lote de Teste de Qualidade

    C->>+GR: POST /batch (JSON payload)
    GR->>+H: CreateBatch(context)
    H->>+H: ShouldBindJSON(data)
    H->>+SF: ParseEntityFromJSON(data)
    SF-->>-H: QualityTestContract
    H->>+RPC: CallMethod("PerformBatchQualityTest", args)
    RPC->>+BESU: Envia transação para Besu
    BESU-->>-RPC: Resultado da transação
    RPC-->>-H: commit, err
    H->>+H: commit.Status().Successful

    alt Commit Successful
        H->>+SF: ExtractBatchInfo(fields, txID)
        SF-->>-H: TransactionData
        H->>+DB: SaveTransaction(TransactionData)
        DB-->>-H: Success
        H-->>-GR: HTTP 200 + JSON Response
    else Commit Failed
        H-->>-GR: HTTP 500 + Error Message
    end

    GR-->>-C: JSON Response

    Note over C, DB: ────────────────────────────────────────

    Note over C, DB: Cenário 2: Consulta de Lote por ID

    C->>+GR: GET /batch/{id}
    GR->>+H: QueryBatchByID(context)
    H->>+H: c.Param("id")
    H->>+RPC: CallMethod("QueryQualityTestBatch", batchID)
    RPC->>+BESU: Consulta leitura no Besu
    BESU-->>-RPC: Batch Data (JSON)
    RPC-->>-H: evaluateResult, err

    alt Query Successful
        H->>+H: json.Unmarshal(evaluateResult)
        H-->>-GR: HTTP 200 + Batch Data JSON
    else Query Failed
        H-->>-GR: HTTP 500 + Error Message
    end

    GR-->>-C: JSON Response

    Note over C, DB: ────────────────────────────────────────

    Note over C, DB: Cenário 3: Health Check

    C->>+GR: GET /health
    GR->>+GR: Health Check Handler (main.go)
    GR-->>-C: HTTP 200 + Health Status

    Note over C, DB: ────────────────────────────────────────

    Note over H: Erro de Validação
    H-->>GR: HTTP 400 + "Dados inválidos"

    Note over RPC: Erro de Conexão Besu
    RPC-->>H: Error: "Failed to connect"
    H-->>GR: HTTP 500 + "Erro ao conectar com Besu"

    Note over BESU: Erro de Smart Contract
    BESU-->>RPC: Contract Error
    RPC-->>H: Transaction Error
    H-->>GR: HTTP 500 + "Erro na execução do contrato"

    Note over DB: Erro DynamoDB
    DB-->>H: Database Error
    Note right of DB: Erro na persistência<br/>(não afeta blockchain)